Package: NPNkorea
Type: Package
Title: Convert the longitude / latitude to Korea's National Point Number (국가지점번호) and vice versa
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Hyein", "Cho",
      email = "hyein.sophia.cho@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Converts between Korea's National Point Number (NPN) grid
    references and WGS84 longitude/latitude coordinates, with support for
    both Hangul and romanized NPN labels.
